---
description: Documentation discipline for Cursor edits.
globs: ["docs/**/*.md", "*.md", ".cursor/rules/*.mdc"]
alwaysApply: true
---

# Docs Policy

- Do not create versioned DEV_REPORT files.
- Only `docs/DEV_REPORT_LATEST.md` may be overwritten for a DEV REPORT.
- Do not add release version strings to docs unless the canonical docs policy explicitly allows it.
- Do not add local timestamps to docs.
- Update `Status_*.md` only after verification evidence exists from the same session.
- Do not update `Roadmap.md` without explicit user approval.
- Run `py -3.11 scripts/check_repo_safety.py` after documentation edits.
